 Start mode
⍝ Register the plugin and start the demo app. mode goes straight to EWC.Init:
⍝ 'Browser' for a single user, 'Multi' for several independent users.
⍝     ]link.create ~/dev/ewc/EWC
⍝     ]link.create FireworksPlugin ~/dev/ewc-plugins/fireworks/APLSource
⍝     ]link.create FireworksApp    ~/dev/ewc-plugins/fireworks/app
⍝     FireworksApp.Start 'Browser'
⍝ Beware hard-coded port, but this is a demo only
 EWC←#.EWC
 EWC.PORT←22322

 #.FireworksPlugin.Register
 EWC.Init mode

 ⎕←'Open http://localhost:',(⍕EWC.PORT),'/'
